{"productId": "8ece6b2a-eb6b-4291-ade7-6f911c341360", "modelName": "PMR30", "modelDescription": "The PMR-30 is a light weight, full size pistol chambered for the flat-shooting .22Magnum cartridge (.22WMR). The PMR-30 operates on a unique hybrid blowback/locked-breech system. This operation system allows for the use of a wide variety of ammunition as it seamlessly adjusts between locked breach and blowback operation, depending on the pressure of the cartridge. It uses a double stack magazine of a new design that holds 30 rounds and fits completely in the grip of the pistol. The trigger is a crisp single action with an over-travel stop. The manual safety is a thumb activated ambidextrous safety lever (up for SAFE, down for FIRE). The slide locks back after the last shot and a manual slide lock lever is also provided. The light, crisp trigger pull and fiber optic sights make the PMR-30 ideal for target shooting and hunting small game.", "manufacturerName": "Kel-Tec", "subProducts": [{"isFirearm": true, "isNfa": false, "subProductId": "c5a0ef48-6127-4147-8a9a-7b401f87277a", "description": "Kel-Tec, PMR 30, Single Action, Hammer Fired, Semi-automatic, Polymer Frame Pistol, Full Size, .22 WMR, 4.3\" Barrel, Matte Finish, Black, Fiber Optic Sights, 10 Rounds, 1 Magazine", "imageUrls": ["https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/e66e142e-f2e8-4891-9853-e8ee4055b374", "https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/0a0d72f6-a59f-47e6-94b9-7b9f8b93c796", "https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/63174dd3-5486-45f8-b903-7fdbbe7e954e", "https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/07a8cfe1-c6b7-4778-a056-d46e28c01182", "https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/fe6ec6c2-cabc-4dd2-b287-a1fc2f16b93c"], "isDefault": true, "manufacturerPartNumber": "PMR30BLK10", "upc": "640832009521", "attributes": [{"attributeNameId": "70cd5184-05d8-42f1-ace2-3bf16911e463", "attributeName": "Barrel Length", "attributeValueId": "8c4369d4-1551-486c-9e44-b50c357d0bab"